<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:50:43.260Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET PRINTER 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET PRINTER command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET PRINTER 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">将控制台命令的输出除显示在屏幕上外，还同时发送至打印机。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET PRINTER ON | OFF | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | OFF<tab />ON 会将输出同时发送至打印机。OFF 则停止此操作。该值也可以是一个宏（&amp;），其求值结果为 ON 或 OFF。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该命令仅更改运行时的 Set.Printer 设置。目前不支持 SET PRINTER TO &lt;file&gt; 这种形式。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibRT" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Command_SET_CONSOLE">SET CONSOLE</link>、<link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_MARGIN">SET MARGIN</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
